      "title": "Vercel MCP now renders deployments as interactive cards in chat clients",
      "summary": "Vercel MCP can now display deployments as an interactive card inside ChatGPT and other chat clients that support MCP apps, providing live deployment status, build logs, and commit details.",
      "key_facts": [
        "Renders deployment status as an interactive card in chat clients",
        "Shows live build logs, source details, and commit information",
        "Includes a Visit button once the deployment URL is ready"
      ],
      "design_implication": "Embedding production build states directly inside conversational chat threads blurs the line between developer tooling interfaces and chat logs. As deployment logs and preview links migrate into conversational UI wrappers, design reviews must account for how engineers inspect failures without leaving the chat context. Start by establishing strict layout hierarchies for inline debugging cards so system error states remain legible inside confined message containers.",
