      "title": "Figma Weave unifies AI generation and editing into repeatable workflows",
      "summary": "Figma Weave combines AI generation and editing tools into connected, reusable workflows designed to give creative teams a consistent and repeatable process.",
      "key_facts": [
        "Brings AI generation and editing together into connected workflows",
        "Designed to create repeatable processes for creative teams",
        "Announced on the Figma Blog"
      ],
      "design_implication": "When design systems teams try to standardize generative outputs, inconsistent prompts often yield wildly different visual structures across screens. Connecting AI generation directly into repeatable workflow chains shifts design operations from managing one-off prompts to maintaining parameterized generation steps. Start by documenting the exact input constraints and token mappings that feed into your team's most common generative components.",
